BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 72 760 Td
(Ilma HP-12 Air-to-Air Heat Pump - User Guide) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Operating modes) Tj T*
(Heat, cool, dry and fan. In heat mode the outdoor unit works down to minus 25 degrees.) Tj T*
(Below minus 15 degrees the heating capacity drops; keep a backup heater for very cold) Tj T*
(nights.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Defrosting) Tj T*
(In cold, humid weather the outdoor unit collects ice. The pump defrosts automatically) Tj T*
(for 5 to 10 minutes; the indoor fan stops and a white cloud of steam from the outdoor) Tj T*
(unit is normal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Filters) Tj T*
(Vacuum the indoor filters every month during the heating season. A dirty filter can) Tj T*
(increase power use by up to 15%.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Service) Tj T*
(Have the heat pump serviced by an authorised installer every two years to keep the) Tj T*
(warranty valid.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Error codes) Tj T*
(A3: outdoor temperature sensor fault. A7: low refrigerant pressure; call the installer.) Tj T*
(H1: defrosting \(not a fault\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Warranty) Tj T*
(5 years on the compressor, 3 years on other parts, from the installation date shown on) Tj T*
(the installation certificate.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
